abstract: >-
  A deterministic quest-economy engine for MMO-style worlds. Rule-based NPCs produce, trade and
  consume goods; unmet economic needs become funded, validated player contracts with
  evidence-based provenance.
keywords:
  - procedural content generation
  - quest generation
  - agent-based simulation
  - game economy
